{"id":7525,"slug":"7525-usenavigation-useroute-typing-voi-typescript-ra-sao","category":"React Native","subcategory":"Navigation","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"`useNavigation` / `useRoute` — typing với TypeScript ra sao?","question_en":"`useNavigation` / `useRoute` — how to type them with TypeScript?","answer_vi":"react-navigation v7 cung cấp generic types để type-safe navigation prop và route params.\n\n**Khai báo param list:**\n```ts\ntype RootStackParamList = {\n  Home: undefined\n  Detail: { productId: string; from?: 'home' | 'search' }\n  Profile: { userId: number }\n}\n```\n\n**Trong screen component:**\n```tsx\nimport type { NativeStackScreenProps } from '@react-navigation/native-stack'\n\ntype Props = NativeStackScreenProps<RootStackParamList, 'Detail'>\nfunction DetailScreen({ route, navigation }: Props) {\n  const { productId, from } = route.params // typed\n  navigation.navigate('Profile', { userId: 42 }) // typed\n}\n```\n\n**Tip 2026:** declare global type-safe navigation bằng module augmentation:\n```ts\ndeclare global {\n  namespace ReactNavigation {\n    interface RootParamList extends RootStackParamList {}\n  }\n}\n```\nKhi đó `useNavigation()` không cần generic — TypeScript tự suy luận.","answer_en":"react-navigation v7 ships generic types for type-safe navigation props and route params.\n\n**Declare the param list:**\n```ts\ntype RootStackParamList = {\n  Home: undefined\n  Detail: { productId: string; from?: 'home' | 'search' }\n  Profile: { userId: number }\n}\n```\n\n**Inside a screen component:**\n```tsx\nimport type { NativeStackScreenProps } from '@react-navigation/native-stack'\n\ntype Props = NativeStackScreenProps<RootStackParamList, 'Detail'>\nfunction DetailScreen({ route, navigation }: Props) {\n  const { productId, from } = route.params // typed\n  navigation.navigate('Profile', { userId: 42 }) // typed\n}\n```\n\n**2026 tip:** declare global type-safe navigation via module augmentation:\n```ts\ndeclare global {\n  namespace ReactNavigation {\n    interface RootParamList extends RootStackParamList {}\n  }\n}\n```\nNow `useNavigation()` infers types without generics.","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">react-navigation v7 cung cấp generic types để type-safe navigation prop và route params.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Khai báo param list:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ts</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type RootStackParamList = {\n  Home: undefined\n  Detail: { productId: string; from?: 'home' | 'search' }\n  Profile: { userId: number }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">RootStackParamList</span> = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Home</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">undefined</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Detail</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">productId</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">from</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;home&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;search&#x27;</span> }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Profile</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">userId</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span> }\n}</code></pre></div><p><strong>Trong screen component:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">tsx</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"import type { NativeStackScreenProps } from '@react-navigation/native-stack'\n\ntype Props = NativeStackScreenProps&lt;RootStackParamList, 'Detail'&gt;\nfunction DetailScreen({ route, navigation }: Props) {\n  const { productId, from } = route.params // typed\n  navigation.navigate('Profile', { userId: 42 }) // typed\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NativeStackScreenProps</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@react-navigation/native-stack&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Props</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NativeStackScreenProps</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">RootStackParamList</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Detail&#x27;</span>&gt;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">DetailScreen</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">{ route, navigation }: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Props</span></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { productId, <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> } = route.<span class=\"hljs-property\">params</span> <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// typed</span>\n  navigation.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">navigate</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Profile&#x27;</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">userId</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">42</span> }) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// typed</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p><strong>Tip 2026:</strong> declare global type-safe navigation bằng module augmentation:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ts</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"declare global {\n  namespace ReactNavigation {\n    interface RootParamList extends RootStackParamList {}\n  }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">declare</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">global</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">namespace</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReactNavigation</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">RootParamList</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">RootStackParamList</span> {}\n  }\n}</code></pre></div><p>Khi đó <code>useNavigation()</code> không cần generic — TypeScript tự suy luận.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">react-navigation v7 ships generic types for type-safe navigation props and route params.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Declare the param list:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ts</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type RootStackParamList = {\n  Home: undefined\n  Detail: { productId: string; from?: 'home' | 'search' }\n  Profile: { userId: number }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">RootStackParamList</span> = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Home</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">undefined</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Detail</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">productId</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">from</span>?: <span cla